Read the complete book as a sustained Portuguese extraction/refining/environment case. Trace characterization, preparation, chemical recovery/refining, residuals, observations, and evidence through a whole system. Its historical operating context and chemical methods require their actual appropriate professional setting; literature/supplied-data work states its scope.

Book identity, editors, year, ISBN, authorized route, and chapter citations were verified through official publisher/repository material on 29 October 2026; a direct whole-book record request timed out. Preserve actual publisher/component rights and later method revisions. Free source access is not a blanket open licence. No source PDF, plant files, or laboratory media is bundled.

